-- Calls `absNumber` from math.l4. The export lowers by name only the
-- functions of prelude.l4 and daydate.l4, so this call is written as L4 with a
-- Blocking note whatever math.l4 holds. Exported against a copy of the
-- libraries whose math.l4 is not the compiled-in copy, the DMN is the same as
-- against an unedited copy, and the report has no D-NOT-LIBRARY note: the file
-- changes nothing in the model, so nothing is lost.
IMPORT math

GIVEN v IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `magnitude` v IS absNumber v
